#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Apply one SP+ Plasma theme as a transactional, observable operation.

The helper is deliberately strict.  It validates the package before touching the
user session, records a timestamped configuration snapshot, applies package
values without inventing replacements, optionally resets the Plasma layout, and
polls real read-backs before reporting success.
"""
